    <guid isPermaLink="false">690f6adaaf4fc00da7c6f9aa</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 08 Nov 2025 16:14:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>反正我剪录音都是用视频软件，不如就干脆拍视频好了</span></p><span></span><p><span>其实没有太大的区别，还能发一个长达40分钟的超长视频，哈哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="128">02:08</a> 我爸得了疝气，我以为疝气就是蛋蛋肿了……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="697">11:37</a> 被广大网友说中了，喜提第一次交通事故，陪了700</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1025">17:05</a> 博主接广告，要给pr多少提成？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1185">19:45</a> 那个突然“变质”的美食博主，我替她感到开心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1477">24:37</a> 面对拖延症，我把自己塞满，让自己无处可躲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1599">26:39</a> 如果全世界的文字，突然之间消失了会怎样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1759">29:19</a> 我爸对我知知甚少，神秘得像别人的儿子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2201">36:41</a> 靓仔下凡来解答-回复留言时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2322">38:42</a> 晚安曲：《I Think I Love You Again》Aaron Taylor</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/618a6919dc2a318780deee8a/ljRBfn-q_JSwsv3piBnUAdDawo9q.m4a" length="31175385" type="audio/mp4"/>
