  <item>
    <title>那天我坐上了刚出狱大哥开的顺风车</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6868e43a93fd2d72b8a5f3c0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6868e43a93fd2d72b8a5f3c0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 05 Jul 2025 08:42:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjR2ek3DGXRFaxGygtxrSzy_zJlI.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>来讲讲最近的奇遇，还有休息的这段时间，我去了哪里。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">01:06</a> &nbsp;打车奇遇，刚出狱大哥求职记</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="708">11:48</a> &nbsp;落地重庆，狠狠被8D城市上了一课</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="973">16:13</a> &nbsp;导游要带着一车的老人去见阎王&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1392">23:12</a> &nbsp;在白帝城看到了10块钱背后的图案：夔门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1499">24:59</a> &nbsp;小三峡遇到的两次推销</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1828">30:28</a> 烟花三月下扬州，比初恋还甜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1921">32:01</a> 生日当天在何圆拍下一张他们的照片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2419">40:19</a> 留言区互动环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2647">44:07</a> 晚安曲：郑宜农 《就算我放弃了世界》 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/618a6919dc2a318780deee8a/lplXudTR9oaWWgLxmdvXewwSJABj.m4a" length="92452832" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:53</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FniSpCM2UaHVBfe-NwcDbU4Fj588.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>人生无常是有时</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67dfa298dd11f9c8c17b6436</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67dfa298dd11f9c8c17b6436</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Mar 2025 06:01:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好好好，其实年前我已经录过一次了，不过成了废案。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期添加了互动的小环节，也是安安静静的。依然希望能陪伴大家好好入睡。</span></p><span></span><p><span>听不完节目就睡着是对本节目最大的认可，哈哈。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="173">02:53</a> MBTI好像是流动的，最近想从新测一次，结果题目太多放弃了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="404">06:44</a> 慢慢的，很多以前不关心的事情，开始与你有了捆绑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="488">08:08</a> 朋友的一场大手术，吓得我立刻预约了体检</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="612">10:12</a> 我仿佛过上了当网约车司机的生活，还是免费的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="794">13:14</a> “稳定的生活”其实早已离我们而去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="895">14:55</a> 我对抗无畏“完美主义”的蠢方法 - 换手机壁纸</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftv8BigQQcDBaTJlZSp5bMVyvrMF.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1056">17:36</a> 新互动环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a> 想换个城市找工作机会应该做点什么准备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1321">22:01</a> 高敏又内向的人，如何跟朋友相处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1602">26:42</a> 晚安曲：《没啥好说》方大同</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/618a6919dc2a318780deee8a/liv29h6OjCVkDfpELWYA3tjuDVCm.m4a" length="58610217" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:30:21</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiBQFawaMJhezNwN7tJvkccbIxZU.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>没想到最近感情升温，是因为听了对象讲普通话</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674adbb70ed328720a707ab3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674adbb70ed328720a707ab3</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 30 Nov 2024 09:44:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 解约了，放假了！不当“博主”了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> 千万不要和一个不靠谱的团队一起工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="903">15:03</a> 第一阶段：报复性娱乐</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj2Qc_RjlA9pDIzytTIbcga3lqii.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1058">17:38</a> 第二阶段：开始自我否定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a> 第三阶段：不上网后，神清气爽，快乐了许多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1306">21:46</a> 当低配得感的人重新把自己养一遍，会看到不一样的世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1481">24:41</a> 原来跟网友吵架是这种感觉，爽！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FviSE8HZlNH4UOUs0jZCdX_Y4Nha.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1691">28:11</a> &nbsp;看到身边的人也开始爱自己，发自内心地觉得开心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1833">30:33</a> 没想到最近感情升温，是因为听了对象讲普通话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2068">34:28</a> 四十岁，我才买了人生第一台低配老头乐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2339">38:59</a> 我到现在还不能接受自己“老花”了</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrYBSNfzvrHTWFfo715jutr1OkDZ.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2504">41:44</a> 晚安曲：《In the End》 Scott Matthew</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是我最爱的一部电影《Short bus》中的插曲，如果你喜欢，建议去搜8分钟的(Long Film Version)版，每次听，脑海中依然能回想起电影中最后那段歇斯底里的狂欢呐喊。看得我泪流满面。</span></p><span></span><p><span>可惜这部电影尺度过大，现在应该很难找到了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>晚安~</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkSPu9JM2atE0pPLFB7vRLMXGBh7.m4a" length="88152192" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:45:39</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgEfbfXdPWydKs7suubd5Mq-ioYZ.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
