  <item>
    <title>我已经用上AI辅助写文案了，真恐怖。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/645e01bc306513184cc699f0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">645e01bc306513184cc699f0</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 12 May 2023 09:07:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>持续在下雨，搬了个凳子，在遮阳伞下录音。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近搬家了，一楼有花园。仿佛回到了小时候，但没了当年在院子里丢球的小同伴。</span></p><span></span><p><span>隔壁的婆婆经常来唠嗑，等黄皮结果了，我准备给他送一点过去。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 给你们听听鸟叫（好像听不清）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnp1o0fQ1m8wXxtx6eeVOu66vwfO.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="229">03:49</a> 接受了《休闲》杂志的采访，编辑很专业，电话里聊了一大堆，总结出的内容都到点子上了。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhTqjkNbkmkuiOdZBGWQYdGw-9MF.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="327">05:27</a> 四舍五入上了个央视，原来耳机后面真的有导演一直在说话啊</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lk8eip3L1zKnwtdcSpnB--5jJQKC.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="612">10:12</a> 今年又去当模特了，持续运动一年后，整个人的精神状态和体态都好了非常多。脸型都变了。自信回来了很多。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrDg2tRpMtQHRe11KD51FFDKsXK6.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="677">11:17</a> 三年没去香港了，一去就被大割韭菜，大家去玩还是提前一个月订酒店吧</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnG-DbZ0SFdXLlKBXl8YyYu6zgXl.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1113">18:33</a> 最近AI两大巨头 我已经用上了C GPT，不得不说…真的很作弊。之后再试试AI绘画看看。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoM9qdsAHbqbgyu0Nwyo-EHoZQBn.JPEG"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqmlnjDkXHKd5oNHaJ3bdJFO5JYo.m4a" length="51440025" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:26:38</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZoTnBUUTUzb2JCNnhpN1FhdnVPUUR1OXhzZmgucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>秀恩爱会变得不幸吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6380eaf37105b234344c103b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6380eaf37105b234344c103b</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 25 Nov 2022 16:18:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>发布的这一天，天气已经开始转凉。</span></p><span></span><p><span>连续失眠了一周，加上一碗很辣的重庆小面，喉咙报废了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我又开始重新调整作息和饮食，仿佛人就是没办法一劳永逸地维持在平静的状态。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a> 最近的心情有了非常大的好转，因为我开始写日记了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="219">03:39</a> 我以为只是摔坏了一个锅盖，其实那是对生活的不满</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">05:55</a> 37岁，我终于开车上路了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="475">07:55</a> 始终不敢面对，父母的老去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="627">10:27</a> 为什么不拍情侣内容？emm……</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：在听风 - 陈越龙 / golden hour - JVKE</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loiSzrR4nUYyJW2zFzohjAukT98_.mp3" length="36709453" type="audio/mpeg"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:18:47</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Z2OXlNeVFYOFZXdUZrLWE4NHNPdERwalcwdFIucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>网络世界怎么那么让人失望呀，我随时想来一杯威士忌酸</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/634e03bde67030aadb38f925</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">634e03bde67030aadb38f925</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 18 Oct 2022 01:39:08 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见，广东的天气终于凉快了起来。这段时间经历了好多事，在混沌中摸着石头过河。屡次尝试调试，也总算获得了一些短暂的平静。先把播客捡起来，其他的再努力看看。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">01:35</a> 报告一下最近的状态，我竟然能坚持运动了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="322">05:22</a> 网络世界怎么那么让人失望呀，我随时都想来一杯威士忌酸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="617">10:17</a> 松弛感这个词，别随便用了吧，听烦了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="919">15:19</a> 结尾曲 &nbsp;鲜于贞娥 - 도망가자</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiTashaWX6cn1qn2tf_QfFGgR0qy.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>是有在认真运动的，选了一家特别小的铁管，大家都在埋头苦干，适合我这种不爱社交的个性。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpdtZzfL8EhroFfG6dEldNQ7jS4r.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>膝盖被杠铃砸得稀烂，还是完全找不到动作要领……</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpKsFyvUBrBKsYn42fvHqbEdFNc1.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>持续了半年的情绪低落，总想找个洞钻，于是经常躲在床底下，柜子底。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmfLX82kbBrkkUXmC3itd-RhWy8K.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>喜欢威士忌酸，加蛋清的版本。就连中间的那一大块老冰都特别美。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsgEmUQI9EIZwQ15s1_CBG2MttXp.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>想我的猫了，晚安。</span></p><span></span><p><span>---------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Bgm：花束みたいな恋を6</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvL2SV-rO2K29e-v5Goi7fZ019wT.m4a" length="38256265" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:19:49</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZwenpyakVsLW9rYVlWQVpaLUI4TzlLY3B2c2cucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
